===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[scratch|Scratching]] the ground for food, as [[domestic]] [[fowl]] or other [[gallinaceous]] birds.
# {{context|ornithology|historical|lang=en}} Pertaining to the now obsolete order [[Rasores]].

